{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>內地人氣唱作歌手汪蘇瀧一連三日於香港啟德主場館舉辦《明日世界 Age of Romance》世界巡迴演唱會，日前首場開鑼全場爆滿。汪蘇瀧在首場演出更重磅邀得天后楊千嬅擔任特別嘉賓，二人驚喜合唱國粵雙語版《如果愛忘了》，瞬間掀起全場高潮！汪蘇瀧現場更預告二人即將推出全新合作歌曲，令在場歌迷大感期待。</p><figure><img alt=\"汪蘇瀧。（HK Ticketing）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1156919572427706368457309.jpeg/N0hxUyLzGSVsS1Fn1vGrAuQlUeBXQ2fNCTRxpgk0caY\"/><figcaption>汪蘇瀧。（HK Ticketing）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"汪蘇瀧在首場演出重磅邀得天后楊千嬅擔任特別嘉賓。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172874456092119040789305.jpeg/R2olEXAb3g5C6rV8CbyhlxQvgGtVeonHAyJYuDkiWLg\"/><figcaption>汪蘇瀧在首場演出重磅邀得天后楊千嬅擔任特別嘉賓。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"二人預告將合作新歌！\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172874959886749696289537.jpeg/K6Sg4qw0lBykn6aRZQ1RGjA4YnYYCdyfnVWzu6dVs7s\"/><figcaption>二人預告將合作新歌！</figcaption></figure><p>然而，演唱會在安歌（Encore）環節發生驚險插曲。汪蘇瀧走近台邊與歌迷熱情握手互動後，現場疑有一名女粉絲因過度興奮或身體不適突然休克倒地。現場工作人員及急救人員發現後迅速趕至，有人即場為該名休克粉絲施以心外壓救援，該名粉絲隨後逐漸恢復意識，最終坐在輪椅上由工作人員陪同護送離開離場。</p><figure><img alt=\"突然有女粉絲休克倒地。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172876830399533056743290.jpeg/tQYOcawOz9EsjKpub5aHBa71T8ViWT-goBwoQaAcKEE\"/><figcaption>突然有女粉絲休克倒地。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"突然有女粉絲休克倒地。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172876840189562880165384.jpeg/RVyQ7eL7gHWFd9H0cvPYr7NG2wgaW1k-alaST2pWkk8\"/><figcaption>突然有女粉絲休克倒地。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"突然有女粉絲休克倒地。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172876837723181056542980.jpeg/RIhBSc7XVibHOgx5yXhxaRvONHid1DzSbDgQYmw4EGI\"/><figcaption>突然有女粉絲休克倒地。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"恢復意識！（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172876835139358720986071.jpeg/A3n3QzX5jCSxfEuweQDjSkjFaHpwwd8sdqzxs3as8bM\"/><figcaption>恢復意識！（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"護送離場。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172878176615927808306541.jpeg/RQp9erO7V0zlpXdwAscvAWFquAL3BMl39PxnbfT8Z20\"/><figcaption>護送離場。（截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T04:38:21.400908+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":415,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}